  <item>
    <title>46 | 为什么同一句话，有人觉得是关心，有人却感到被绑架？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693eae8937f52a644ee137db</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693eae8937f52a644ee137db</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 21 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一句无心的玩笑，为何会引爆一场关系危机？</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人感到</span><strong><span>被控制而瞬间应激</span></strong><span>，有人却</span><strong><span>满心委屈与不解</span></strong><span>，最终选择退群远离。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【核心问题讨论】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>「被冒犯」是我的问题，还是TA的错？</span></strong><span>感受与事实，到底谁说了算？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>一开口就被曲解，还有必要沟通吗？</span></strong><span>“被误解”是常态，还是关系危机的信号？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>说出来会惹事，不说会内伤，到底该怎么选？</span></strong><span>表达真实的感受，是一种自私吗？</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>照顾别人与保护自己，只能二选一？</span></strong><span>如何在关系中设立边界，而不显得冷漠？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【内容详情】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> </span><strong><span>【万万视角】“何至于此？”</span></strong><span>： 玩笑之后，万万经历的困惑、委屈与退缩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="452">07:32</a> </span><strong><span>【焦焦视角】“我被绑架了”</span></strong><span>： 攻击性背后，焦焦感受到的控制、恐惧与瞬间的情绪决堤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">12:42</a> </span><strong><span>【破冰尝试】各自的心路历程</span></strong><span>： 矛盾第二天，焦焦主动发起对话时，双方内心上演的“小剧场”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a> </span><strong><span>【第三方观察】“入室抢劫”式的暴力沟通</span></strong><span>： 当情绪浓度极高时，对话如何演变为对话语权的争夺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> </span><strong><span>【转机】三人对话：看见问题的存在</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>媛媛介入，帮助识别“情绪闪回”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>当朋友想处理冲突，即使自己没有准备好，万万也会让自己上场🥹</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2846">47:26</a> </span><strong><span>【核心认知】感受 vs. 事实</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>我们如何固执地将感受当作客观事实</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>控诉别人在控制，其实自己也在控制</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a> </span><strong><span>【创伤溯源】恐惧与控制，冲突与逃跑</span></strong><span>： 焦焦为何恐惧被控制、万万面对冲突时为何想逃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3852">01:04:12</a> </span><strong><span>【中间人视角】两难与需求</span></strong><span>： 在冲突中，我们真正渴望的是：被确认合理性，以及确信自己未被伤害</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4041">01:07:21</a> </span><strong><span>【超越对错】走向自我觉察</span></strong><span>： 争吵的最后，重点不再是分辨对错，而是看见彼此的感受、需求与未愈的创伤</span></p><span></span><p><span>💬 加入讨论</span></p><span></span><p><span>你有没有被某人触发情绪闪回，明明不是某人的错，却想把责任甩给对方的时刻？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67501ffc8163319b245c58a7/lo0xYM27eXd06xjNmrucR68vBHNL.m4a" length="73432955" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:15:40</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn8onVHDZJN9Xg4yb17ZCn-GpZQX.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>46</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>45 | 原来平凡的日子，就是最好的日子：这一年，感谢你在</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69326a1f3fec3166cf63088e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69326a1f3fec3166cf63088e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Dec 2025 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>转眼间，这档播客已经陪伴我们走过了一整年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一年，它像一面镜子，照见我们三个人的关系，也映出各自的变化。那些毫无防备的聊天、突如其来的眼泪、肆无忌惮的笑声……在真实的碰撞中，坚硬的人变得柔软，柔软的人长出了棱角。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们更了解彼此，也更看清自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最让我们感到幸福的，是发现这份真实的联结，也能为你的生活带来一丝温暖或慰藉。历经种种后我们越发确信：</span><strong><span>平凡普通的日子，就是最好的日子。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>就像我们这期的BGM所唱：过了爱做梦的年纪，轰轰烈烈不如平静。能找到平静聊天的伴，本身，就是一件“没那么简单”却无比幸运的事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容详情】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> &nbsp;「</span><strong><span>全新的体验」</span></strong><span>跟朋友安静的聊天，放松的让眼泪流下来，是从来没有过的体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="960">16:00</a> &nbsp;「</span><strong><span>“酸味”时刻</span></strong><span>」有的人的酸味隔着屏幕都能闻到了，你们快来闻闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> &nbsp;「</span><strong><span>自己的成长</span></strong><span>」</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>更擅长表达感受、跟人的链接更深</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>突破了对自己的很多限制，允许自己放手、放下羞耻允许自己做自己</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>播客是关系的象征</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> &nbsp;「</span><strong><span>年度最爱单集盘点</span></strong><span>」盘一盘我们过去的欢乐和眼泪</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ea73f3f9578163d617799a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ea73f3f9578163d617799a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>花钱心疼，不花钱浑身刺挠</span></a><span>——人均研究生，只有我们仨是本科</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68288bae457b22ce0d2b530a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68288bae457b22ce0d2b530a?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>活着活着都忘了，我是会死的</span></a><span>——回看过去的内容，看到了自己状态的变化</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685fd4a2bef90978ec57958e?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685fd4a2bef90978ec57958e?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>草台班子大舞台，会演精英你就来</span></a></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d5e505522b40626c4f8ece?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d5e505522b40626c4f8ece?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>深度沟通</span></a><span>——不一样的焦焦和万万，反复收听</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689548bf46542d8c410f27d7?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/689548bf46542d8c410f27d7?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>佛学：能接受自己所有面，慈悲心就有了</span></a><span>——没什么计划的一期，聊着聊着也把很多事串起来了，很多点都说通了</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a8476c247d51713c8473b8?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67a8476c247d51713c8473b8?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>第一次聊离婚上新星榜</span></a><span>——那是万万和朱老师只为焦焦的痛苦而存在的一刻，特别美好、幸福</span></li><span>  </span><li><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6800cc831f1db84a56e46073?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6800cc831f1db84a56e46073?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>跟媛媛聊婚姻</span></a><span>——我以为婚姻是浪漫爱情的延续，其实不是。醍醐灌顶</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2929">48:49</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>「对下一年的期待」</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>希望我们的内容能给大家带来一些治愈的感觉</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>平凡普通的日子就是好日子</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>刚认识的时候都很热烈，过了“热恋期”，希望我们拥有细水长流平淡的幸福</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3772">1:02:52</a> &nbsp;</span><strong><span>「爱的语言」</span></strong><span>你如何爱人？期待如何被爱？</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>理解对方爱的语言很重要</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>表达自己期待如何被爱也能让想爱你的人更顺畅的表达爱</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>👉 点击收听，在我们的故事里打捞自己的答案</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最最后，焦焦和媛媛的播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ca071f1adc3d617d8815ee?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/68ca071f1adc3d617d8815ee?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTYzZmNiZTBmNWU3MjNiYjY1MmY1MyJ9"><span>《离了更好》</span></a><span>蹭一下咱的流量，欢迎订阅～</span></p>]]></description>
